{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"calibre.calibre","latestVersion":"9.17.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"calibre is the one stop solution to all your e-book needs.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"calibre is the one stop solution to all your e-book needs.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"calibre is an e-book manager. It can view, convert, edit and catalog e-books in all of the major e-book formats. It can also talk to e-book reader devices. It can go out to the internet and fetch metadata for your books. It can download newspapers and convert them into e-books for convenient reading. It is cross platform, running on Linux, Windows and macOS.","moniker":"calibre","name":"calibre","packageUrl":"https://calibre-ebook.com/","publisher":"Kovid Goyal","publisherUrl":"https://kovidgoyal.net/","tags":["ebook","epub","kindle","mobi","reader","viewer"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"calibre 是满足您所有电子书需求的一站式解决方案。","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kovidgoyal/calibre/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"calibre 是一款电子书管理器，可以查看、转换、编辑和编目所有主流格式的电子书；可以连接电子书阅读器设备；可以从互联网获取电子书的元数据；可以下载报纸并将其转换成电子书以方便阅读；并且是跨平台的，可在 Linux、Windows 和 macOS 上运行。","name":"calibre","packageUrl":"https://calibre-ebook.com/zh_CN","publisher":"Kovid Goyal","publisherUrl":"https://kovidgoyal.net/","tags":["epub","kindle","mobi","电子书","阅读器"]}},"longDescription":"calibre is an e-book manager. It can view, convert, edit and catalog e-books in all of the major e-book formats. It can also talk to e-book reader devices. It can go out to the internet and fetch metadata for your books. It can download newspapers and convert them into e-books for convenient reading. It is cross platform, running on Linux, Windows and macOS.","moniker":"calibre","nam